.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-page-show 1  "show " 
.SH NAME
tine\-page\-show \- Show a page\*(Aqs outline (the text a window shows, unsaved edits included)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine page show\fR [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a page\*(Aqs outline (the text a window shows, unsaved edits included)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<GRAPH>\fR
The graph. Defaults to $TINE_GRAPH, else the graph folder around the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the typed result (schema tine.cli/1) as JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPAGE\fR>

